NEW 2-BEDROOM + 1 APARTMENT IN A GATED COMMUNITY IN THE HISTORIC CENTRE OF SINTRA

Discover this elegant brand-new 2-bedroom + 1 apartment, located in a charming gated community in the heart of the historic centre of Sintra.

A development that combines the characteristic architecture and charm of Sintra with the comfort, energy efficiency and technological solutions of contemporary construction.

The apartment stands out for its excellent layout, natural light and efficient use of space, providing a modern, comfortable and functional living environment.

The social area comprises a spacious living room, with the possibility of creating two distinct areas, and a modern, fully equipped kitchen.

The private area features two bedrooms, one of which is en-suite, as well as a full bathroom.

The apartment also offers a distinctive +1 room, an extremely versatile space that can be converted into an additional en-suite bedroom, private living room, library, home office or leisure area, easily adapting to the needs of each family.Main Features of the Apartment

Brand-new 2-bedroom + 1 apartment

Fully equipped kitchen

Two bedrooms, one of which is en-suite

Multifunctional +1 room

Two full bathrooms

Built-in wardrobes in the bedrooms

Excellent storage space

Mechanical ventilation system (VMC) throughout the apartment

Air conditioning

Hot water supplied by a heat pump

Excellent use of available spaceThe Building and Gated Community

The building has been designed to provide comfort, energy efficiency and quality of life, featuring:

External thermal insulation system ETICS (external insulation/render system)

Silence acoustic glazing

Private communal garden

Parking

Individual wallbox for electric vehicle charging

Elegant communal entrance

Landscaped areas currently being completed, where it is already possible to appreciate the pleasant and private atmosphere of the developmentA Truly Privileged Location

Living here means being in the heart of Sintra, surrounded by traditional shops, restaurants, cafés, services and public transport, while enjoying the tranquillity and extraordinary historical and natural surroundings that make Sintra truly unique.

An especially attractive opportunity for those looking for a new, comfortable and distinctive home in the centre of Sintra, whether for permanent residence or as an investment.

Come and discover a new way of living in Sintra.&nbsp;
